  "reviewer_note": "Both detailed pages are by one author (Sorkhabi: AAPG 2018, GeoExpro 2008), so the day, time and depth rest on a single researcher; OGEL (a different publisher) confirms only May 1908. Encyclopaedia Iranica, BP and UNESCO pages returned 403 and were not opened. AAPG is a professional society, classed scholarly with doubt. The pin is the town centre, not the well.",
